  "description": "Year 0, Day 1: \"Auditory hallucination,\" Lucas decided, and blew out his birthday candle.\n\n【INITIATING EARTH MUTATION PROGRAM: PHASE 1】\n\nBy morning the world had changed, and his neighbor was trying to break down his door to kill him.\n\nLucas didn't panic. He had worked since he was a kid, and panic never changed an outcome yet. He handled the neighbor. By afternoon he had killed enough to trigger a reward notification, so he collected the drops, logged them, and kept moving. There were places to reach and supplies didn't wait.\n\n\"So it starts,\" he muttered. \"Fine.\"",
